  "constituent_colleges": {
    "note": "Unrelated to the 2021 restructure below -- a different, ongoing institutional category. A constituent college is not yet chartered as its own university, so it confers its parent institution's degrees under supervision until it earns a charter. Historical precedent in Kenya: Kenya Polytechnic University College (-> Technical University of Kenya) and the University of Embu both went through this stage before being chartered independently. Treated as Faculty-equivalent rows in this system so alumni who graduated through them have somewhere to attach -- not part of the 10 restructured faculties, and not one of the 6 abolished legacy colleges below.",
    "colleges": [
      {
        "name": "Koitaleel Samoei University College",
